    {"id":"docs_adr_0080_releases_must_be_non_inferior_in_every_mandatory_stratum_releases_must_be_non_inferior_in_every_mandatory_stratum","label":"Releases must be non-inferior in every mandatory stratum","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"D:\\Deepseek\\DSH  Security Assurance\\docs\\adr\\0080-releases-must-be-non-inferior-in-every-mandatory-stratum.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"A candidate must meet pre-registered non-inferiority margins in each mandatory risk, weakness, mode, and platform stratum; aggregate gains cannot hide a regression."},
